---
List available countries from the selected combination's boundary source

Usage: popcircles country list [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --combination <COMBINATION>  Combination ID; defaults to the configured country combination
      --log-level <LEVEL>          How much to report on stderr: `error`, `warn`, `info` or `debug`. It does not govern the progress meter, which answers how far a run has got rather than what happened [default: info]
      --config <PATH>              Optional configuration file layered over data/config.toml
      --resolution <RESOLUTION>    Prepared resolution; defaults to that combination's default resolution
  -h, --help                       Print help
